        {
          "id": 1731452277,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "There are hundreds of us at ATT that use this feature to pull entire SIP PDUs out of Wireshark PCAPs and paste them into SIPP XML scripts, emails, Word docs, etc.  The OP was incorrect that it is already working as \"Value\".  Copy as Value only works if yous elect and individual SIP header, not the entire PDU. \n\nPlease add this feature back in or you are going to leave a lot of folks on old release.",
