          "id": 1731446824,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Never does the right thing is incorrect.\n\nRemoval of this feature is a huge problem for those that copy entire SIP PDUs (as printable text) and paste them into SIPP XML files to reproduce calls in telco networks.  Please add this functionality back in.",
